    },
    "A drive was detected, but there's no vehicle to log it against. Add your car in MileLog so the next one is saved." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a notification when a trip is not saved because the user has no vehicle.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zaznana je bila vožnja, vendar ni vozila, h kateremu bi jo lahko zabeležili. Dodajte svoje vozilo v MileLog, da se bo naslednja shranila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A month's trips stay editable until you generate its report after the month ends, or until this many days into the next month. Once locked, a trip's mileage / date / vehicle become immutable. Edits to purpose, customer, and notes are still allowed but recorded in the audit log." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vožnje meseca lahko urejate, dokler po koncu meseca ne ustvarite njegovega poročila oziroma do toliko dni v naslednjem mesecu. Ko je vožnja zaklenjena, kilometrov, datuma in vozila ni več mogoče spreminjati. Namen, stranko in opombe lahko še urejate, spremembe pa se zapišejo v revizijski dnevnik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O aplikaciji"
