    },
    "It may have expired or already been used. Request a new one with “Forgot password?” below." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in a sheet when the password reset link fails.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Morda je potekla ali je bila že uporabljena. Zahtevajte novo s »Ste pozabili geslo?« spodaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It now has a locked (already-reported) trip, so its name, plate, type, and Potni Nalog details can't be changed here — those edits were discarded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zdaj ima zaklenjeno (že poročano) vožnjo, zato imena, registrske tablice, tipa in podatkov za potni nalog tukaj ni mogoče spremeniti — te spremembe so bile zavržene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was locked or updated elsewhere while open, so mileage and type can't be changed here — those edits were discarded. Purpose, customer and notes were saved." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user tries to save a trip that's been changed by someone else.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Med urejanjem je bila zaklenjena ali posodobljena drugje, zato kilometrine in tipa tukaj ni mogoče spremeniti — te spremembe so bile zavržene. Namen, stranka in opombe so shranjeni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its distance and route were measured by GPS and haven't been saved. This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "A message in a confirmation dialog that appears when the user tries to dismiss a trip that's in progress.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Njena razdalja in pot sta bili izmerjeni z GPS in še nista shranjeni. Tega ni mogoče razveljaviti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its mileage and any classification will be permanently removed. This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in a confirmation dialog.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
