    "Off — trips won't be detected automatically" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Izklopljeno — vožnje se ne bodo samodejno zaznavale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Free plan one vehicle records. Until you choose, the one you drove last records." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V brezplačnem paketu se beleži eno vozilo. Dokler ga ne izberete, se beleži zadnje uporabljeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Free plan only this vehicle records. Your other vehicles and all their trips stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V brezplačnem paketu se beleži samo to vozilo. Druga vozila in vse njihove vožnje ostanejo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a month MileLog sends rough counts — how many automatic trips, reports, receipts and month-end checks, in ranges such as 11–15 — with no trips, places or device details. It helps decide the Free plan's limits. Nothing depends on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enkrat na mesec MileLog pošlje približna števila — koliko samodejnih voženj, poročil, računov in pregledov ob koncu meseca, v razponih, kot je 11–15 — brez voženj, krajev ali podatkov o napravi. To pomaga določiti omejitve brezplačnega paketa. Od tega ni odvisno nič."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a month MileLog would send rough counts — such as 11–15 automatic trips — with no trips, places or device details. You can change this in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enkrat na mesec bi MileLog poslal približna števila — na primer 11–15 samodejnih voženj — brez voženj, krajev ali podatkov o napravi. To lahko spremenite v Nastavitvah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once locked, a trip's mileage / date / vehicle become immutable. Edits to purpose, customer, and notes are still allowed but recorded in the audit log." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Po zaklepanju postanejo kilometrina / datum / vozilo nespremenljivi. Spremembe namena, stranke in opomb so še vedno dovoljene, vendar zabeležene v revizijskem dnevniku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings" : {
      "comment" : "A button that opens the iOS Settings app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
